# Keep the original fork controller's live state, frozen snapshots, request
# bodies, prompts, raw GitHub responses and local tools out of Git.
#
# Only explicit summaries under results/<batch-id>/published/ may be committed.
# Each repository still has its private, resume-critical checkpoint at
# results/<batch-id>-rNNNN/. Never force-add those checkpoint directories.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!*/
*/**
!*/published/
*/published/**
!*/published/attempts.csv
!*/published/attempts_4000.csv
!*/published/manifest.json
!*/published/trials/
*/published/trials/**
!*/published/trials/r????.json
